Package: tessera
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Conflicts: litehub
Replaces: litehub
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine, qt6-svg-plugins, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, pipewire, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: gbnanoengineer <gbnanoengineer@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Lightweight all-in-one messenger hub (WhatsApp, Slack, Discord, Gmail, ...)
 One window for many web services, each instance with its own isolated login:
 several WhatsApps (linked-device QR login), Gmails, Outlooks, Telegram, Slack,
 Discord, Teams, Messenger and any custom site. Chromium (Qt WebEngine) engine
 with working calls, video and screen sharing; shared download manager with
 Open buttons; tray, notifications, per-service custom CSS/JS; services can
 sleep to save RAM. Unofficial; not affiliated with any of these services.
